Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.87,0:03:03.43,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,50)\bord2.5\blur6\3c&H775D24&\fsp-45\fscx100\fscy100}{\move(500,1060,960,1060,0,150)}{\t(0,150,\fsp3)}{\t(100,12000,0.2,\fscx113\fscy100)}{\t(1400,12000,0.7,\fsp9)}以一路跌跌撞撞才终于获得的孤傲
