Comment: 0,0:23:05.21,0:23:05.25,EDJP,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.24,0:22:22.29,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.8\blur8\fad(150,150)}果てなき夢　続く旅の途中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.07,0:22:28.19,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.8\blur8\fad(150,150)}まだ見えぬ明日を覗いてみる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.41,0:22:34.63,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.8\blur8\fad(150,150)}そこにあるのは仲間の笑顔か
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.00,0:22:40.63,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.8\blur8\fad(150,150)}絶望か怒りかわからないけど
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.05,0:22:46.65,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.8\blur8\fad(150,150)}どれほど熱く希(こいねが)っても
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.00,0:22:51.80,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.8\blur8\fad(150,150)}過去には戻れないから
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.81,0:22:58.18,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.8\blur8\fad(150,150)}せめて未来だけはこの手で今
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.41,0:23:02.30,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.8\blur8\fad(150,150)}築いてゆこう
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.42,0:23:05.50,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.8\blur8\fad(150,150)}いつか辿り着く遥か彼方の地には
Comment: 0,0:23:10.64,0:23:16.25,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.8\blur8\fad(150,150)}深い喜びが待っているんだろう
Comment: 0,0:23:16.44,0:23:22.24,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.8\blur8\fad(150,150)}いつもこの胸に咲き溢(こぼ)れる笑顔を
Comment: 0,0:23:22.61,0:23:27.81,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.8\blur8\fad(150,150)}守るため同じ空へ
Comment: 0,0:23:28.21,0:23:33.81,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.8\blur8\fad(150,150)}迷いのない軌跡重ねて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.24,0:22:22.29,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.8\blur8\fad(150,150)}在延续无尽梦想的旅途中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.07,0:22:28.19,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.8\blur8\fad(150,150)}尝试窥见尚未知晓的明天
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.41,0:22:34.63,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.8\blur8\fad(150,150)}尽管不知会见到伙伴笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.00,0:22:40.63,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.8\blur8\fad(150,150)}还是绝望抑或是愤怒
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.05,0:22:46.65,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.8\blur8\fad(150,150)}不论多么热切期望
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.00,0:22:51.80,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.8\blur8\fad(150,150)}都无法回到过去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.81,0:22:58.18,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.8\blur8\fad(150,150)}所以至少现在就用这双手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.41,0:23:02.30,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.8\blur8\fad(150,150)}建构未来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.42,0:23:05.50,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.8\blur8\fad(150,150)}在终将抵达的遥远彼端之地
Comment: 0,0:23:10.64,0:23:16.25,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.8\blur8\fad(150,150)}有着莫大喜悦在等待吧
Comment: 0,0:23:16.44,0:23:22.24,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.8\blur8\fad(150,150)}为了守护总是绽放于心中的笑容
Comment: 0,0:23:22.61,0:23:27.81,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.8\blur8\fad(150,150)}而朝向同一片天空
